{"availability":"available","full":"majieddd/charforge","name":"charforge","description":"Text prompt to rigged, animated, game-ready 3D character. Entirely local on Apple Silicon. Live playground + the measurements behind every claim.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-21T00:08:55Z","updated":"2026-10-08T03:29:32Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://majieddd.github.io/charforge/","topics":["3d","apple-silicon","blender","character-generation","gamedev","mlx","rigging","skinning","threejs","trellis"],"demo":"https://majieddd.github.io/charforge/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:18.727Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:18.727Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:18.727Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:18.727Z","stars":0,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Three.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A text prompt or an image goes in; a rigged, animated character comes out that you can drop into a game engine - glTF and FBX, a Mixamo skeleton with fingers and a jaw, a face that blinks and talks, PBR textures, level-of-detail meshes and a manifest of everything a character controller needs. It works in three art styles - realistic, anime and stylised - with one pipeline, and everything runs locally on an Apple Silicon laptop: image generation, 3D generation, segmentation, the solid, retopology, hands, rigging, skinning, the face rig, texture projection, retargeting and packaging.","▶ Open the live playground - a small game level with a character controller driving the generated characters. WASD moves relative to the camera (strafes and back-pedals included), Shift sprints, X walks, C crouches, Space jumps (fall off the platform for the hard landing), hold Q or the right mouse button to aim - the character faces the camera and strafes - E waves, the number keys play moves made from a video, hold T to talk. Swing the camera and the character turns in place. Each character downloads only when selected; Download fetches its package.","📄 Read the paper - CharForge: rigged, animated game characters from a few words or one image, on a laptop, a living research paper: the method stage by stage, every measurement (regenerated from the pipeline's own files), related work with sources, negative results and the roadmap. Beside it: the lab notebook (the day-by-day record) and the experiment tracker (what is planned, running, done and dropped - start there to pick the work up), plus the research gap review (evidence and next measurements for each pipeline stage). Rebuild the paper with python paper/collect.py && python…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majieddd/charforge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8354e19d77bd99a2f88823dc242a3c690a85587b4d0db5fdcf8d87afbec4d76f","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:18.927Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:18.927Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A text prompt or an image goes in; a rigged, animated character comes out that you can drop into a game engine - glTF and FBX, a Mixamo skeleton with fingers and a jaw, a face that blinks and talks, PBR textures, level-of-detail meshes and a manifest of everything a character controller needs. It works in three art styles - realistic, anime and stylised - with one pipeline, and everything runs locally on an Apple Silicon laptop: image generation, 3D generation, segmentation, the solid, retopology, hands, rigging, skinning, the face rig, texture projection, retargeting and packaging.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majieddd/charforge/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8354e19d77bd99a2f88823dc242a3c690a85587b4d0db5fdcf8d87afbec4d76f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majieddd/charforge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:18.927Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T03:29:32Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/